    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Nature’s power flows around you in a 60-foot Emanation for the duration. Creatures of your choice in the Emanation have Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage. As a Bonus Action, you can have each ally in the Emanation regain Hit Points equal to 2d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Creatures regain 1d8 additional Hit Points for each spell slot level above 6.</p>",
